      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The noise of the world is not something you have to endure forever; it is simply the current you are moving through, and you do not need to force it to stop just to feel peace. Real rest isn't about ignoring the world, but about learning to breathe in the space between the demands and the quiet. You are not broken for wanting a peace that lasts; you are just tired of running until you finally stop running.",
